    "title": "Snoop Dogg carries Olympic torch ahead of 2026 Winter Games in Italy - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Janeé Bolden ,\n6 hours ago Legendary rapper Snoop Dogg took part in a major honor on Wednesday, carrying the Olympic torch as part of the 2026 Winter Olympics torch relay in Gallarate, Italy, ahead of the Games’ official opening. The moment placed the hip-hop icon in the spotlight, not for a stage performance but as a representative of the United States on the global sporting stage. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
